      "-10^4 <= nums[i] <= 10^4"
    ],
    "notes": [
      "a single element (answer is 1)",
      "a strictly decreasing array (answer is 1)",
      "an already strictly increasing array (answer is the full length)",
      "an array with many repeated values"
    ],
